2 CONT 1498–1519
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Clarice de' Medici
2 CONT 1493–1528
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Alessandro "il Moro" de Medici
2 CONT 1510–1537
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine de Medici
2 CONT 1519–1589
