2 CONT *'''Catherine de Medici1
2 CONT *'''F, #103079, b. 13 April 1519, d. 5 January 1589
2 CONT *Last Edited=4 Dec 2008
2 CONT *'''    Catherine de Medici was born on 13 April 1519.1 She was the daughter''' of Lorenzo II de Medici, Duca di Urbino and Madeleine de la Tour.4 '''She married Henri II, Roi de France''', son of François I, Roi de France and Cla
2 CONC ude de Valois, Duchesse de Bretagne, '''on 28 October 1533.1 She died on 5 January 1589 at age 69.
2 CONT *'''     She gained the title of Comtesse de Lauraguais.1 She gained the title of Comtesse d'Auvergne.1
2 CONT *'''Children of Catherine de Medici and Henri II, Roi de France
2 CONT **François II, Roi de France b. 16 Jan 1544, d. 5 Dec 1560
2 CONT **Elizabeth de Valois, Princesse de France+ b. 1545, d. 1568
2 CONT **Claude de Valois, Princesse de France+ b. 1547, d. 1575
2 CONT **Louis de Valois b. 1549
2 CONT **Charles IX, Roi de France+ b. 27 Jun 1550, d. 30 May 1574
2 CONT **Henri III, Roi de France b. 19 Sep 1551, d. 2 Aug 1589
2 CONT **Marguerite d'Angoulême5 b. 14 May 1553, d. 27 Mar 1615
2 CONT **Hercule François de Valois, Duc d'Alençon et Anjou b. 1554, d. 1584
2 CONT **Victoire de Valois b. 1556
