2 CONC  or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 82. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *[S130] Wikipedia, online http;//www.wikipedia.org. Hereinafter cited as Wikipedia.
