2 CONT
2 CONT On 26 November 1570 Charles married Elisabeth of Austria[6], with whom he fathered one daughter, Marie Elisabeth of Valois (1572–1578). In 1573, Charles fathered an illegitimate son, Charles, Duke of Angoulême, with his mistress, 
2 CONC Marie Touchet.[7]
2 CONT
