2 CONT On his last day, 30 May, Charles called for Henry of Navarre, embraced him, and said, "Brother, you are losing a good friend. Had I believed all that I was told, you would not be alive. But I always loved you... I trust you alone 
2 CONC to look after my wife and daughter. Pray God for me. Farewell."
2 CONT
