1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''LOUIS XIII King of France and Navarre (Château de Fontainebleau 27 Sep 1601-Saint-Germain-en-Laye 14 May 1643, bur Saint-Denis)'''
2 CONT s/o  HENRI IV King of France & Maria de' Medici Pss of Tuscany 
2 CONT x 1615 Infanta doña ANA of Spain, d/o FELIPE III & Margareta Archduchess of Austria (Valladolid 22 Sep 1601-Louvre 20 Jan 1666, bur Saint-Denis)
2 CONT *LOUIS XIV (Saint-Germain-en-Laye 5 Sep 1638-Versailles 1 Sep 1715, bur Saint-Denis)
2 CONT *PHILIPPE  (Saint-Germain-en-Laye 21 Sep 1640-Château de Saint-Cloud 9 Jun 1701, bur Saint-Denis).  Duc d’Anjou
