2 CONT Princess Margherita of Savoy1     Margherita di Savoia, Principessa di Savoia was born on 28 April 1589 at Turin, Italy.1 She was the daughter of Carlo Emanuele I, Duca di Savoia and Catalina Micaela von Habsburg.1 She married Fra
2 CONC ncesco IV Gonzaga, 5th Duca di Mantova, son of Vincenzo I Gonzaga, 4th Duca di Mantova and Eleonora de Medici, in 1608.1 She died on 25 June 1655 at age 66 at Miranda.1 Child of Margherita di Savoia, Principessa di Savoia and Fran
