2 CONT         1. Louis Thomas d.1702, Count of Soissons
2 CONT
2 CONT         2. Eugene 1663-1736, Prince of Savoy, called The Famous General
2 CONT
2 CONT     3. Louise-Christine (1627 - 1689), married in 1654 to Ferdinand Maximilian of Baden-Baden (1625 † 1669), and was mother of the famous general Louis, Margrave of Baden-Baden.
2 CONT
