2 CONT
2 CONT      Ludovica Maria di Savoia was born on 27 July 1629. She was the daughter of Vittorio Amadeo I, Duca di Savoia and Marie Christine de Bourbon, Princesse de France. (1) She married Maurizio di Savoia, Principe di Savoia, son of 
2 CONC Carlo Emanuele I, Duca di Savoia and Catalina Micaela von Habsburg, on 28 August 1642 at Turin, Italy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 14 May 1692 at age 62.
