2 CONT F, #220213, b. 2 October 1666, d. 3 May 1739
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=3 Oct 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Anne de Bourbon was born illegitimately on 2 October 1666 at Vincennes, France. (1) She was the daughter of Louis XIV, Roi de France and Louise Françoise de la Baume le Blanc, Duchesse de la Vallière. (1) She married Louis A
2 CONC rmand I de Bourbon, Prince de Conti, son of Armand de Bourbon, Prince de Conti and Anne Marie Martinozzi, on 16 January 1680 at Saint-Germain-en-Laye, Île-de-France, France. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 3 May 1739 at age 72 at Paris, France, without issue. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Marie Anne de Bourbon was also known as Mademoiselle de Blois. (1) In March 1667 her birth was legitimised. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p22022.htm#i220213
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis XIV of France
2 CONT
2 CONT Illegitimate Children of Louis XIV of France
2 CONT
2 CONT By Louise-Françoise de La Baume Le Blanc, duchesse de La Vallière et de Vaujours (6 August 1644 – 6 June 1710)
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Marie-Anne de Bourbon, Mlle de Blois, duchesse de La Vallière, princesse de Conti	2 October 1666	3 May, 1739	Legitimised on 14 May 1667. Married Louis-Armand I de Bourbon-Conti, prince de Conti.
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
