2 CONC Versailles and never married; became the Abbess of Chelles in 1719; she died at Chelles; known as Mademoiselle de Chartres, she was later known as Madame d'Orléans; Charlotte Aglaé d'Orléans Duchess of Modena and Reggio 	Orléans, 
