2 CONT
2 CONT Duchess Maria Anna Victoria of Bavaria
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT For other people named Maria Anna of Bavaria, see Maria Anna of Bavaria (disambiguation).
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Anne Victoire
2 CONT
2 CONT Dauphine of France
2 CONT
2 CONT la Grande Dauphine
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Anna holding the coronet of the Dauphine of France, Posthumous portrait, François de Troy
2 CONT
