2 CONT
2 CONT Full name
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Anna Christine Victoria
2 CONT
2 CONT House 	House of Bourbon
2 CONT
2 CONT House of Wittelsbach
2 CONT
2 CONT Father 	Ferdinand Maria, Elector of Bavaria
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother 	Princess Henriette Adelaide of Savoy
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 	28 November 1660(1660-11-28)
2 CONT
