2 CONT Italian and German nobility. She was born the only daughter of Cosimo III and his wife Marguerite Louise de Orleans. In 1691 she was married to Johann Wilhelm von der Pfalz. Although arranged the marriage was happy. After her husb
2 CONC and's death she returned to Florence. In 2012 her grave was opened, and her remains were studied by anthropologists, forensic pathologists, and geneticists. The scientist was surprised that she did not wore a classical burial crow
2 CONC n but her husband's Electoral hat.
