2 CONC oogle.com/books?id=MxpnAAAAMAAJ&focus=searchwithinvolume&q=Catherine+FitzCharles GoogleBooks]. Died an infant.
2 CONT * “Charles the Second, king of England, Scotland, and Ireland.” by Hutton, Ronald Publication date 1989 Topics Charles II, King of England, 1630-1685. Page 125.  [https://archive.org/details/charlessecondkin00hutt/page/124/mode/2u
2 CONC p Archive.Org] A nun, or died young.
2 CONT * https://www.englishmonarchs.co.uk/stuart_33.html
