2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_FitzJames,_1st_Duke_of_Berwick '''James FitzJames of Berwick''']
2 CONT * [http://thepeerage.com/p10505.htm#i105048 '''peerage.com'' ]
2 CONT * [http://indigo.ie/~wildgees/duke1.htm '''The Duke of Berwick, James FitzJames, Marshal of France''']
