2 CONT Henrietta Crofts Paulet, Duchess of Bolton, was born in about 1682. She was the daughter of James Scott, Duke of Monmouth, and Eleanor Needham. She married Charles Powlett, 2nd Duke of Bolton, son of Charles Paulet, 1st Duke of Bo
2 CONC lton and Mary le Scrope. She was buried on 10 March 1729/30 at Old Basing. (Source: The Peerage, F, #69474)
2 CONT
