1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Charles Paston, Lord Paston''', of Oxnead Hall, Norfolk  was born on 29 May 1673.
2 CONT
2 CONT His parents were *Charlotte and William Paston, 2nd Earl of Yarmouth:
2 CONT
2 CONT His mother *Charlotte FitzRoy or FitzCharles (Charlotte Jemima Henrietta Maria; c. 1650 – 28 July 1684) was one of the many acknowledged illegitimate children of Charles II of England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lord Paston was married to Elizabeth Pitt and had a daughter, [http://www.geni.com/people/Hon-Elizabeth-Paston/6000000023111367297?through=6000000012537425296 Hon. Elizabeth Paston].
2 CONT
2 CONT Lord Charles Paston died on 15 December 1718 
2 CONT
