2 CONT Filippo di Borbone, Duca di Parma was born on 15 March 1720 at Madrid, Spain. (3) He was the son of Felipe V de Borbón, Rey de España and Isabella Elizabeth Farnese. He married Louise Elisabeth de Bourbon, daughter of Louis XV, Ro
2 CONC i de France and Marie Charlotte Sophie Leszczynska, Princess of Poland, on 25 October 1739 at Alcalá de Henares, Spain. (3) He married Louise Elisabeth de Bourbon, daughter of Louis XV, Roi de France and Marie Charlotte Sophie Les
2 CONC zczynska, Princess of Poland, on 26 August 1739 at Versailles, Île-de-France, France, in a proxy marriage. (3) He died on 18 July 1765 at age 45 at Alessandria, Italy. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Filippo di Borbone, Duca di Parma was a member of the House of Bourbon. He gained the title of Infante de España. He succeeded to the title of Duca di Parma in 1748. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Filippo di Borbone, Duca di Parma and Louise Elisabeth de Bourbon
