2 CONT "<strong>VANE, Hon. Frederick</strong> (1732-1801), of Sellaby, co. Dur. - b. 26 June 1732, 2nd s. of Henry, 1st Earl of Darlington, by Lady Grace Fitzroy, da. of Charles, 2nd Duke of Cleveland and Southampton; bro. of Henry, Visc
