2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT Lady Caroline Keppel was born on 20 August 1737. She was the daughter of William Anne van Keppel, 2nd Earl of Albemarle and Lady Anne Lennox. She died on 11 September 1769 at age 32. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Robert Adair (1711-16 March 1790).   They were the parents of: 
2 CONT
2 CONT # Sir Robert Adair b. 24 May 1763, d. 3 Oct 1855 
2 CONT # Elizabeth Adair b. c 1769, d. 2 Mar 1841.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
