2 CONC ormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 434. 
2 CONT * John Debrett, editor, DeBretts Peerage, Baronetage, Knightage and Companionage (London, U.K.: n.pub., 1790), volume 1, page 216.
