2 CONC ber 1782), married Charles Dillon, 12th Viscount Dillon General Hon. Edmund Phipps (7 April 1760 – 14 September 1837) Hon. Augustus Phipps (1762–1826) Phipps died on 13 September 1775, aged 53.
