1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sources:'''
2 CONT **"Acadian Immigrants to Lafourche des Chitimachas/Valenzuéla, 1785-86" - http://www.acadiansingray.com
2 CONT ***At Port-Toulouse 1752, age 7
2 CONT ***Deported from Île Royale to St.-Malo, France, aboard Queen of Spain 1758, arrived St.-Malo 17 Nov 1758, listed as Louis D'antin, no age given
2 CONT ***In Poitou, France, 1773-75
2 CONT ***In Third Convoy from Châtellerault to Nantes, France, Dec 1775
2 CONT ***On list of Acadians at Nantes, Sep 1784, listed as Louis Dantin, a widower 
2 CONT ***Sailed to la Luisiana on ''L'Amitié'', age 38[sic]
2 CONT ***Valenzuela, la Luisiana census, 1788, listed as Louis Dantain, age 40[sic]
2 CONT ***Valenzuela, la Luisiana census, 1791, age 40[sic]
2 CONT ***Valenzuela, la Luisiana census, 1795, listed as Luis, age 52[sic]
2 CONT ***Valenzuela, la Luisiana census, 1797, listed as Louis Dantain, age 53
2 CONT ***Valenzuela, la Luisiana census, 1798, listed as Louis Dantain, age 54
2 CONT ***Succession inventory dated 28 Apr 1827, Thibodeauxville courthouse
2 CONT ***Succession public sale dated 19 Jun 1830, Lafourche Interior Parish courthouse
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Notes:'''
2 CONT **Arrived in current day Louisiana Nov 1785
2 CONT ----
