2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis Scott, Earl of Dalkeith was born on 19 February 1721.
2 CONT He was baptised on 18 March 1720/21 at St. Martin-in-the-Fields Church, Covent Garden, London, England.
2 CONT He married Caroline Campbell, Baroness Greenwich, daughter of Field Marshal John Campbell, 2nd Duke of Argyll and Jane Warburton, on 2 October 1742 at Bruton Street, London, England.
2 CONT He died aged 29 at Adderbury, Oxfordshire, England, from smallpox.
2 CONT He was buried at Dalkeith Castle, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Francis Scott, 2nd Duke of Buccleuch and Lady Jane Douglas.
