2 CONT * Death:	Jan 13 1868 - Twickenham, Middlesex, England
2 CONT * Parents:	Hon Colonel George Napier, Lady Sarah Bunbury Then Napier (born Lennox)
2 CONT * Siblings:	Louise Bunbury, Louis Bunbury Gordon, Charles James Napier, Emily Louisa Augusta Bunbury (born Napier), Sir George Thomas Napier, William Francis Patrick (Sir ) Napier, Duncan Campbell Napier, Sarah Myers (born Napier)
2 CONC , Captain Henry Edward Napier, Rn, Caroline Henrietta Napier, Cecilia Mary Napier
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lady_Sarah_Lennox
2 CONT
2 CONT >Lady Sarah married an army officer, Hon. George Napier, on 27 August 1781 and had eight children:
2 CONT
2 CONT **'''Richard Napier''' (1787 – 13 January 1868); married Anna Louisa Stewart, daughter of Sir J. Stewart, in 1817.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Stewart was the daughter of Sir James Stewart, 7th Bt. and Mary Susanna Whaley.1,2 She married, secondly, Richard Napier.3 She married, firstly, William Conolly Staples, son of Rt. Hon. John Staples and Harriet Conolly, in Ju
2 CONC ly 1797.3 She died on 30 March 1867.1
2 CONT
2 CONT  Her married name became Napier.3 From July 1797, her married name became Staples.1
2 CONT
