0 @N6000000002322281955@ NOTE Inheriting from his forebears a deep respect for arts and letters, he became
1 CONT a poet hinself as well as a patron of artists and a skilled statesman. His
1 CONT three children, however, played contrasting roles in the city's (Florence)
1 CONT history. In commeration of his death and the death of his son Giuliano at
1 CONT relatively young ages, the Medici family commissioned Michelangelo to
1 CONT complete the Medici tombs in Florence.
