1 CONT
1 CONT Duke of Cornwall and Duke of Rothsay, etc. at birth, declared (butneve r
1 CONT crowned) Prince of Wales 1638, crowned King of Scots at Scone 1 Jan,16 51, lived
1 CONT in exile in France, Germany and Holland 1651-60.  Crowned by WilliamJu xon,
1 CONT Archbishop of Canterbury.
