0 @N6000000000551178522@ NOTE Charles Radclyffe (M) b. 3 September 1693, d. 8 December 1746, #78948d. 8 Dec 1746|p7895.htm#i78948|Edward Ratcliffe, 2nd Earl of Derwentwater|b. 9 Dec 1655d. 29 Apr 1705|p10843.htm#i108424|Mary Tudor|b. 16 Oct 1673d. 1726|p10504.
