1 CONT Mary Tudor was the daughter of Charles II Stuart, King of Great Britain <p10139.htm> and Mary Davies. She was born on 16 October 1673. She married Edward Ratcliffe, 2nd Earl of Derwentwater <p10843.htm> on 18 August 1687. She marr
1 CONC ied Henry Graham <p10843.htm>, son of Colonel James Graham <p2314.htm> and Dorothy Howard <p2314.htm>, on 23 May 1705. She married James Rooke <p10843.htm> on 26 August 1707. She died in 1726.1 She died on 5 November 1726 at age 5
1 CONC 3 at Paris, France.  She was also known as Mary Tudor. She was a singer and actress.
