1 CONT heiress of Lord Edward Herbert of Powis Castle, brother of last Marquis of Powis
1 CONT Educated and concealed under the feined name of D'Hoblerfield
1 CONT Charlotte, her aunt concerned about her proposed marriage to Lord Montagu's son 10.1749
1 CONT Also ? proposal Duke f Beaufort
1 CONT Proposed clandestine marriage to Mr. Brown, son of Lord Montacute / Montagu, stopped by French king
1 CONT Lord Montagu was her guardian
1 CONT
1 CONT Took a prominent role during her son's minoritya compulsive gambler known as the Macaroni Rake
1 CONT
1 CONT buried 22.3.1786 Welshpool
